{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14301054","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14301054","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1430105401:1":{"text":"빵만 남은 거였으면 모를까, 맥주까지 남았다고!","source_cn":"如果只剩下面包或许说不定，可是他们竟然连啤酒都剩了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9B013A93EC198FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1430105402:1":{"text":"전에 빵을 배급하던 드워프는 항상 맥주가 부족하다고 불평했단 말이야.","source_cn":"要知道，之前负责领面包的矮人永远都在跟我抱怨啤酒不够喝。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4EA76B44720E5D82","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1430105403:1":{"text":"입맛이 없는 것보다, 무슨 일이 생긴 건 아닌지 걱정이 되는데...","source_cn":"比起担心他们的胃口，我更担心他们是不是出了什么事……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C319A9A10AA7415","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:矮人巴尔姆":{"text":"드워프 바룸","source":"矮人巴尔姆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}